SUMMARY:Hillhaven
DESCRIPTION:Thursday May 28th\, 2026\nDoors | 7:00 PM\nShow | 8:00 PM \nGeneral Admission Standing Room | $22.40 + Fees \n+$3 on All Day of Show Purchases\nThis event is all ages – 21+ With Valid ID to Drink\nCome hungry! Snacks and light bites will be available at the canteen.\n—————————————————\nPresented by Big Fan Presents\n—————————————————\nAll Proceeds Benefit Heart Support \nHillhaven is – Chris Kelly (Vocals)\, Jaime GoWell (Guitars)\, & Zach Moiser (Drums) \nHillhaven emerged\, seemingly out of nowhere\, in April of 2024. Featuring some familiar faces and boasting radio-tailored blend of rock and metalcore\, lasting attention was quickly gained from listeners and radio programmers alike. By May of 2024\, Hillhaven was a regular feature on rock music’s premiere radio station – Sirius XM Octane\, with one single winning regular rotation through their coveted Test Drive\, and two more being premiered and kept in rotation later that year. \nHillhaven’s seemingly endless onslaught of rock & metalcore anthems persisted every month of 2024\, until the band made its live debut at the annual Metalcore festival \, Christmas Burns Red – sharing the bill with August Burns Red\, The Ghost Inside\, The Devil Wears Prada & More. \nNow\, under the roster of Grandview Management & Sound Talent Group\, with a fresh new lineup and new body of work on the way\, Hillhaven is primed and ready to continue its rapid ascent into hard rock stardom. This is just the beginning… \nCheck out Hillhaven here!\nInstagram | Facebook  \nSupported by: Making A Mockery & RUINESS\n—————————————————\n*Ticket Alert*  \nTickets for Mickey’s Black Box are sold through TicketMaster\, via our website\, or in person at our Box Office. Any tickets purchased elsewhere will not be honored and we are not responsible for tickets purchased from any 3rd party sellers.  Do not google the name of the band to search for tickets.  Go to Mickeysblackbox.com ONLY. Mickeysblackbox.com will never direct you anywhere but the official TicketMaster event site. \n\nAll bags are subject are to search upon entry. Tickets are non-refundable\, save for instances in which performances are cancelled by Mickey’s Black Box. For more information about our venue or to make an ADA request\, please visit the FAQ page of our website: https://mickeysblackbox.com/faq/ or call our box office line at (717) 723 – 8463.
URL:https://mickeysblackbox.com/event/hillhaven/
LOCATION:Mickey’s Black Box\, 101 Rock Lititz Boulevard\, Lititz\, PA\, 17543\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mickeysblackbox.com/app/uploads/2026/04/IMG_2660-1-e1776427517683.jpeg
END:VEVENT
