SUMMARY:Rob's Rock School Presents: Summer Jam Showcase
DESCRIPTION:Sunday May 31st\, 2026\nEARLY SHOW!\nDoors | 2:30 PM\nShow | 3:00 PM \nGeneral Admission Standing Room | $15.70 + Fees\nReserved Balcony & Mezzanine Seating | $15.70 + Fees \n+$5 on All Day of Show Purchases\nThis event is all ages – 21+ With Valid ID to Drink\nCome hungry! Snacks and light bites will be available at the canteen.\n————————————————–\nPresented by Rob’s Rock School\n————————————————–\nCome out and support the students of Rob’s Rock School! \nPerforming 2 hours of feel good summer music! Song selections from Led Zeppelin\, Queen\, AcDc\, My Chemical Romance\, Social Distortion and more! Performers range in ages from 5-70 years old.   \nCheck out Rob’s Rock School here!\n————————————————–\n*Ticket Alert* \nTickets for Mickey’s Black Box are sold through TicketMaster\, via our website\, or in person at our Box Office. Any tickets purchased elsewhere will not be honored and we are not responsible for tickets purchased from any 3rd party sellers. Do not google the name of the band to search for tickets. Go to Mickeysblackbox.com ONLY. Mickeysblackbox.com will never direct you anywhere but the official TicketMaster event site. \n\nAll bags are subject are to search upon entry. Tickets are non-refundable\, save for instances in which performances are cancelled by Mickey’s Black Box. For more information about our venue or to make an ADA request\, please visit the FAQ page of our website: https://mickeysblackbox.com/faq/ or call our box office line at (717) 723 – 8463.
